# Build context for the Cloudflare Containers image (`wrangler deploy` builds it with Docker).
# Keep it minimal: the container needs ONLY production node_modules + dist/server.cjs.
#  - `dist/*` is ignored, then `dist/server.cjs` is un-ignored (the one required artifact).
#  - `dist/index.html` + `dist/assets/*` are NOT shipped: the SPA is served by
#    Workers Static Assets (`assets.directory: "./dist"`), not by the container.
node_modules
cf-worker-dist
dist/*
!dist/server.cjs
api
src
tests
server
scripts
docs
patch
.git
.github
.vscode
.wrangler
*.log
.env*
!.env.example
p12_read*.txt
_backup_prod_feature_pre.sql
_db_step3_backup.txt
_db_step7b_restore.sql
_payment_migration_audit.txt
